    "url": "https://www.incometax.gov.in/iec/foportal/",
    "summary": "The page is reachable over HTTPS (200, no redirects) and has no broken links among the 50 checked. It is held back by missing meta description, an http:// canonical on an https page, and a malformed heading structure. Mobile lab performance is 72 (LCP 4.9 s), though real-user Core Web Vitals are all rated FAST.",
    "findings": [
      {
        "category": "meta_tags",
        "issue": "The canonical URL uses http:// while the page is served over HTTPS, sending a conflicting signal about the preferred URL.",
